BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0abeca47-6be9-3454-9adf-60e2da2e6eae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
